  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3001.02 Scope. Any person whose motor vehicle registration has been suspended or revoked pursuant to RSA 261:180, III shall be eligible to apply for a hardship registration.\n\nSource. #5027, eff 12-19-90; ss by #6296, eff 7-23-96, EXPIRED: 7-23-04; ss by #10085, eff 1-31-12\n\nNew. #8181, eff 9-25-04; ss by #10085, eff 1-31-12; ss by #13279, eff 10-19-21",
